WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.213
What this proves.

2
00:00:01.213 --> 00:00:06.831
Every active HR record has its accounts,
every terminated one has none enabled,

3
00:00:06.831 --> 00:00:11.585
and every enabled account belongs
to a person: account management,

4
00:00:11.585 --> 00:00:16.512
AC-2, and Book 3's leaver and orphan
measures, kept as each run's output.

5
00:00:16.512 --> 00:00:20.965
Drift is measured on a schedule, and
what changed between runs is reported:

6
00:00:20.965 --> 00:00:23.812
continuous monitoring
and system monitoring.

7
00:00:23.812 --> 00:00:27.516
And what wasn't measured is stated,
not implied, which feeds the

8
00:00:27.516 --> 00:00:31.874
Federal Modernization Workbook's Book
13's detection coverage measure.

9
00:00:31.874 --> 00:00:35.520
The not-computed list and the
refusal are that evidence.
